{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119780","id":3747939631,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7fZQUv","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119780","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119780.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119780.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119780","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119780/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119780/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119780/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/ec93662dd423f4a6acedd227cd7b3bb580636867","number":119780,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix C# caught exceptions not reaching custom loggers","user":{"login":"nongvantinh","id":53887662,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODg3NjYy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53887662?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nongvantinh","html_url":"https://github.com/nongvantinh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nongvantinh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nongvantinh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nongvantinh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nongvantinh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nongvantinh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nongvantinh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nongvantinh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nongvantinh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nongvantinh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\r\n\r\n- `ExceptionUtils.LogException` now always calls `GD.PushError` after optionally sending to the script debugger, matching `LogUnhandledException`.\r\n- Fixes caught C# exceptions not appearing in `OS.add_logger()` custom loggers, file logging, or the standard `OS.print_error` pipeline during editor play when the script debugger is active.\r\n\r\n## Problem\r\n\r\nWhen the script debugger is active (typical editor run), caught C# exceptions were sent only via `godotsharp_internal_script_debugger_send_error` → `RemoteDebugger::send_error`. They never went through `GD.PushError` → `_err_print_error` → `OS::print_error`, so custom loggers and project file logging did not see them. The editor debugger UI still showed them.\r\n\r\nPreviously, `GD.PushError` ran only in the `else` branch (debugger inactive).\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\n\r\nAlways call `GD.PushError(e.ToString())` after `SendToScriptDebugger`, same pattern as `LogUnhandledException`.\r\n\r\n\r\nCloses: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115283\r\nCloses: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/54389\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":709269775,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MDkyNjk3NzU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:dotnet","name":"topic:dotnet","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292